<title>NORWAY: List of Norway's new Labour government members.</title>
<headline>List of Norway's new Labour government members.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the official list of Norway's new minority Labour government to be sworn in later on Friday:</p>
<p> Prime Minister.....................Thorbjoern Jagland</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs....................Bjoern Tore Godal</p>
<p> Environment........................Torbjoern Berntsen</p>
<p> Local Government, Labour...........Kjell Opseth</p>
<p> Health.............................Gudmund Hernes</p>
<p> Industry, Oil &amp; Energy.............Grete Faremo</p>
<p> Transport &amp; Communications.........Sissel Roenbeck</p>
<p> Industrial Affairs.................Grete Knudsen</p>
<p> Overseas Development...............Kari Nordheim Larsen</p>
<p> Defence............................Joergen Kosmo</p>
<p> Finance............................Jens Stoltenberg</p>
<p> Social Affairs.....................Hill-Marta Solberg</p>
<p> Education &amp; Church Affairs.........Reidar Sandal</p>
<p>Minister without portfolio,</p>
<p>responsible for national planning..Terje Roed Larsen  Agriculture........................Dag Terje Andersen</p>
<p> Justice and Police.................Anne Holt</p>
<p> Fisheries..........................Karl Eirik Schuett-Pedersen</p>
<p> Culture............................Turid Birkeland</p>
<p>Children and Family Affairs</p>
<p> and Government Administration......Sylvia Brustad</p>
</text>
